WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
A dark field of connected points introduces a shift away from traditional search.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
An AI prompt interface illustrates people asking AI questions.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
An example brand website appears among connected points and AI interfaces.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
The letters GEO appear, introducing generative engine optimization.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
A light panel shows an illustrative AI recommendation card naming Arrow AI.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
The film introduces authority and labels for citations, recommendations and linked sources.

00:28.000 --> 00:32.000
A dark closing panel encourages viewers to participate in the AI era.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
The Arrow AI logo and website conclude the film.
